  "version": 8,
  "name": "Building heights",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Every footprint stepped by measured height in meters \u2014 light blue low-rise through dark blue mid-rise, with the 60m+ downtown towers in red. About nine in ten St. Louis buildings carry a height; the rest read as gray. Building parts draw on top with the same ramp."
  },
